/*
  # Recompute seed verdicts after the thermal-channel de-duplication

  The thrust budget previously counted "convection" and "buoyancy" as two
  channels with algebraically identical formulas — the same Δρ·A·h physics
  twice. Fixed in the engine; the seeded historical claims were computed
  with the double-counted budget, so their stored verdicts and residuals
  are refreshed here by the corrected engine (regenerated from the same
  codegen path as the originals). Idempotent: delete-then-insert of the
